@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam nodesep 48
skinparam ranksep 52
skinparam defaultFontName "Noto Sans CJK SC"
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam ArrowColor #475569
skinparam roundcorner 12
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFF7DB
skinparam noteBorderColor #D4B45D
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
title 一次显式学习动作如何更新服务端 Profile
hide footbox
box "客户端" #DBEAFE
participant "Extension" as ext
endbox
box "服务端公开协作" #DCFCE7
participant "API use case" as api
participant "Learning" as learning
participant "Vocabulary Profile" as profile
participant "worker" as worker
endbox
ext -> api : S1 提交 known 或 unknown 意图
api -> learning : S2 条件接受并幂等持久接收
learning -> learning : S3 提交 event 与 accepted revision
learning -> profile : S4 尝试同步应用 evidence
alt 同步投影成功
profile --> api : S5 投影成功、缓存失效与 version
api --> ext : S6 一次最终响应 accepted 与 version
else 同步投影失败
profile --> api : S7 投影失败但 event 已接受
api --> ext : S8 一次最终响应 projection pending
end
opt accepted event 仍有待修复投影
worker -> learning : S9 从 durable event 恢复归约
learning -> profile : S10 幂等应用仍有效的 evidence
profile -> profile : S11 推进投影并失效旧服务端缓存
end
api -> profile : S12 后续提示读取已提交 snapshot
@enduml
